Z||000000||Cheever2||01-11-2001||08:44 PM||||I just now collected the following phrases from currently active topic subject names.  No wonder these aren't just cars to us, they're our babies, our flesh & blood!<BR>-<BR>They've got <B>new pockets</B>, <B>flappin eye lids</B>, wearing a <B>headliner kit</B> on their <B>stock heads</B>, smiling and showing off their <B>shock tower braces</B>.<BR>Although they have a <B>cold start</B>, they <B>keep running</B>, in spite of a <B>wiggle in the back end</B> and <B>creaking brakes</B>.  And the poor souls have <B>no cat</B> to play with.  No wonder we need <B>name badges</B>, so you can tell which one is the car!  <P>Regarding <B>ball joints</B>, <B>lugnuts</B> and <B>mounting holes</B>, well, even I won't go there.<P>BTW, just what <I>is</I> a <B>"vanden plas"</B>, and how do you pronounce it?<P><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
