Z||000005||frontal lobe||01-12-2001||01:53 AM||||Vanden Plas is pronounced "vahn den plahs", and when you say it you have to kind of put your nose up a little and with your eyes kind of look down a little on the person you are saying it to in order to get the full effect.  Then ask for some GrEy (not grAy like us yanks) poupon and you are set.<P>It's a model/trim level of a "jag-u-ah" (do NOT say "jag-wire" or you have severely blown it).||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||01-12-2001||03:55 AM||||Vanden Plas is actually a Dutch name an more correctly, is written as "van den Plas".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
